**Read:** [Large Volume Inorganic Chemicals — Ammonia, Acids and Fertilisers, BREF LVIC-AAF](../sources/Ammonia-Acids-Fertilisers-BREF.lingua#r_45NWBJYAMXXSRV071A57EM02GB), the whole general treatment and complete relevant acid/fertiliser chapters; [Large Volume Inorganic Chemicals — Solids and Others Industry, BREF LVIC-S](../sources/Inorganic-Solids-and-Others-BREF.lingua#r_1M61GTSHDW8CPV4PNH48PTB4Y4), the whole relevant product and generic method chapters; [Production of Speciality Inorganic Chemicals, BREF SIC](../sources/Speciality-Inorganic-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_04G7NFYXE76QCB3DXCRJC1FSCP), the entire pertinent specialty/quality comparison; [Inorganic Chemical Technology — Nanda Kishore, NPTEL](../sources/Inorganic-Chemical-Technology-Kishore.lingua#r_77Z8T5RFYFNNXZ7XKZFKPRKDKR), the full inorganic manufacturing progression revisited.

Choose an acid, salt or solid inorganic family and reconstruct its full feed-to-qualified-product route from complete technical chapters and primary methods. Include actual feed variability, phases, reaction network, separation, product specification, utilities, equipment/material state, service work and residuals.

Derive the consequential element/species, inventory, phase and energy accounts independently. Reproduce a substantial quantitative result with a second method or limiting calculation. Explain the thermodynamic, kinetic, transport and analytical evidence supporting the chosen models and identify a plausible competing mechanism or route.

Compare an actual alternative feed, chemistry or process arrangement on the same accepted output and time basis. Test property, recovery, impurity and utility uncertainties rather than changing a single favorable assumption in isolation. Trace at least one consequential impurity through product, recycle and residual streams.

**Work:** produce a substantial technical/research-style study with complete bibliography, primary methods, derivations, inspectable original calculations, actual observations or clearly identified external data, uncertainty and defended conclusions. Obtain independent criticism of a central claim, revise from evidence and identify the next unresolved scientific or practical question.

**Continue:** [Defend a complete chemical-production system from feed through useful product and recovery](Integrated-feed-to-qualified-chemical-product-and-recovery-study.lingua#r_65F3X7EQ6C2Y13CN33EYQTW77X).

**Return:** [Industrial chemistry — chemical transformations, useful products and continuing production](../Industrial-chemistry.lingua#r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618).
